        "original_id": "0eabe017-0d77-53f0-ab55-5c93d1aa3d8b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Irad Ortiz Jr.\n- Horses: Lady Eli, Creator\n- Events: Breeders' Cup, 2016 Belmont Stakes, Preakness Stakes, Kentucky Derby\n- Concepts: American Classic, American Triple Crown, Thoroughbred horse racing\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, Irad Ortiz Jr. won his first Breeders' Cup race on Lady Eli.\n- On June 11, 2016, the 2016 Belmont Stakes was run over 1+1/2 miles in Thoroughbred horse racing.\n- The Belmont Stakes is known as the \"test of the champion\" and is the final jewel in the American Triple Crown series.\n- The 2016 Belmont Stakes was held three weeks after the Preakness Stakes and five weeks after the Kentucky Derby.\n- In the 2016 Belmont Stakes, Irad Ortiz Jr. won his first American Classic on Creator.",
